<title>SWITZERLAND: SBC calls Sept 18 news conference.</title>
<headline>SBC calls Sept 18 news conference.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corporation (SBC) called an unscheduled news conference for Wednesday, September 18, and promised to send a full announcement by fax to news media at 7:15 a.m. (0515 GMT) that morning.</p>
</text>
